msgid ""
"The bank account of your company is not trusted. Please ask an admin or "
"someone with approval rights to check it."
msgstr "您公司的银行账户未受信任。请让管理员或具有审批权限的人员检查。"

#. module: account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account/models/account_move.py:0
#: code:addons/account/models/account_move.py:0
